# Apple Stock Data Analysis Dashboard
# Environment Variables Configuration
# 
# This is a static frontend application that does not require any environment variables.
# The dashboard loads data directly from the AAPL.csv file included in the repository.
#
# Optional Configuration (for future enhancements):
# ================================================
#
# If you plan to add a backend API for real-time stock data:
# STOCK_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
# STOCK_API_URL=https://api.example.com/v1
#
# For analytics tracking:
# ANALYTICS_ID=your_analytics_id
#
# For error monitoring:
# SENTRY_DSN=your_sentry_dsn
